From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pratinav Seth <pratinav.seth@lexsi.ai>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:31:20 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] sarvam_moe: sarvamai/sarvam-30b support

DeepSeek-V3-style MoE semantics in MoE: sigmoid router in fp32, expert_bias
(selection only), group-limited top-k, routed_scaling_factor, shared expert,
per-expert contribution hooks. first_k_dense_replace dense blocks via a
per-layer cfg in TransformerBlock. convert_sarvam_moe_weights (fused QKV
split, per-head qk-norm); registry + cfg_dict from the checkpoint config.

